__pycache__/
*.pyc
# .env matched literally, not .env* - real secrets files beyond plain
# .env (.env.production, .env.staging, etc.) were NOT covered by this
# until now, a genuine gap: the tracked templates (.env.example,
# .env.production.example) are re-included explicitly below so this
# still doesn't block committing those.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
